Code mods (.nrm) on Android: execmod-safe page swapping for hooked pages, patch windows crossing a page
boundary, i-cache flush after patching. By Rival, from AurelioB/N64ModernRuntime pull request #1 (for
AurelioB/BanjoRecomp-Android issue #15), unchanged. GPL-3.0 like N64ModernRuntime.

